<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>base-bundle-forum — demo</title>
    <style>
        body { font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 60rem; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; } h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
        section { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding: .8rem 0; }
        .about { color: #666; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
        pre { background: #f6f6f6; padding: .6rem .8rem; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .ok::before { content: "[OK] "; color: #060; }
        .error::before { content: "[FAILED] "; color: #a00; }
        .go { display: inline-block; margin: 1rem 0; padding: .6rem 1.2rem; background: #FF3399; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>omnibase/forum</h1>
    <p>A forum built on base-bundle's <code>Thread</code>: boards, topics, markdown posts, tags, likes, follows and moderation. This page seeds a small board and checks the wiring; the forum itself is the link below.</p>

    <a class="go" href="{{ path('forum_index') }}">Open the forum →</a>

    {% for section in sections %}
    <section>
        <h2 class="{{ section.ok ? 'ok' : 'error' }}">{{ section.title }}</h2>
        <p class="about">{{ section.about }}</p>
        <pre>{{ section.output }}</pre>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
</body>
</html>
